nh dùng do not / does not: \"Tom does not like coffee.\" (hay: doesn't).\nLịch sự khi gọi món: thêm \"please\" ở cuối câu. \"I want ...\" hơi thẳng; dùng \"..., please\" khi nói với người phục vụ.\nBữa ăn: breakfast (bữa sáng), lunch (bữa trưa), dinner (bữa tối) — nói \"for breakfast\" (cho bữa sáng).","lessonId":"u3n6l6","lessonVersion":"v2.u3n6l6","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u3n6","order":21,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u3n6l6","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"9x_c5JtdlzkmcC-fFYErIfH4ChQnDXTRA3OvFOge_3PT79yzSERbvR-GmScw77ltaRqWS8Wsn7EUp1ZmOkTQCg","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["speaking","u3.grammar","u3.dialogue","u3.vocab"],"title":"Ngon quá! · Bài 6","unitId":"u3"}